                           THE C-INDEX DEMONSTRATION DISK

            This Demonstration Disk is supplied to help you evaluate the
            capabilities of C-Index.  With the manual supplied on disk,
            interactive demonstration program and example source code,
            you can evaluate the major features of the C-Index system.

            We encourage you to make copies of the Demonstration Disk
            software and documentation, provided that:

                 a.   copies are used only for the purposes of
                      evaluating C-Index and no money is charged for
                      copies.

                 b.   the C-Index documentation and software are not
                      modified.

                 c.   the following copyright notice appears on all
                      copies:

                      (c)Copyright 1983-1993, Trio Systems, Pasadena, CA


            Please feel free to provide copies of the Demonstration Disk
            to your friends and associates.


                          FILES ON THE DEMONSTRATION DISK


            DOCUMENTATION

            The following files contain documentation about C-Index:

            readme.doc          General release information.
            cindex.doc          Excerpts from the complete manual.


            DEMONSTRATION PROGRAM

            The example program, including full source code, allows the
            user to interactively try out all the C-Index Multi-Key
            functions:

            example.exe         Example demonstration program.
            example.c           Main source for example program.
            example.fil         Data file for example.



